  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_01",
      "original_maia2_item": 2,
      "text": "I notice when I am uncomfortable in my body.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_02",
      "original_maia2_item": 3,
      "text": "I notice where in my body I am comfortable.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_03",
      "original_maia2_item": 4,
      "text": "I notice changes in my breathing, such as whether it slows down or speeds up.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_04",
      "original_maia2_item": 6,
      "text": "I distract myself from sensations of discomfort.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_05",
      "original_maia2_item": 9,
      "text": "I push feelings of discomfort away by focusing on something",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_06",
      "original_maia2_item": 10,
      "text": "When I feel unpleasant body sensations, I occupy myself with something else so I don’t have to feel them.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_07",
      "original_maia2_item": 11,
      "text": "When I feel physical pain, I become upset.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_08",
      "original_maia2_item": 12,
      "text": "I start to worry that something is wrong if I feel any discomfort.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_09",
      "original_maia2_item": 15,
      "text": "When I am in discomfort or pain I can’t get it out of my mind",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "negative",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_10",
      "original_maia2_item": 17,
      "text": "I can maintain awareness of my inner bodily sensations even when there is a lot going on around me.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_11",
      "original_maia2_item": 19,
      "text": "I can return awareness to my body if I am distracted.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_12",
      "original_maia2_item": 20,
      "text": "I can refocus my attention from thinking to sensing my body.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_13",
      "original_maia2_item": 25,
      "text": "I notice that my body feels different after a peaceful experience.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_14",
      "original_maia2_item": 26,
      "text": "I notice that my breathing becomes free and easy when I feel comfortable.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_15",
      "original_maia2_item": 27,
      "text": "I notice how my body changes when I feel happy / joyful.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_16",
      "original_maia2_item": 29,
      "text": "When I bring awareness to my body I feel a sense of calm.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_17",
      "original_maia2_item": 30,
      "text": "I can use my breath to reduce tension.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_18",
      "original_maia2_item": 31,
      "text": "When I am caught up in thoughts, I can calm my mind by focusing on my body/breathing.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_19",
      "original_maia2_item": 32,
      "text": "I listen for information from my body about my emotional state.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_20",
      "original_maia2_item": 33,
      "text": "When I am upset, I take time to explore how my body feels.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_21",
      "original_maia2_item": 34,
      "text": "I listen to my body to inform me about what to do.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_22",
      "original_maia2_item": 35,
      "text": "I am at home in my body.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_23",
      "original_maia2_item": 36,
      "text": "I feel my body is a safe place.",
      "response_options_key": "maia2_likert",
      "valence": "positive",
      "exclude_from_score": false,
      "safety_flag": false,
      "safety_trigger": null
    },
    {
      "item_id": "maia2_brief_24",
      "original_maia2_item": 37,
      "text": "I trust my body sensations.",
